Source correspondence:
  knowledge.py: SOCResourceSet and public resource-event accounting
  opening.py: OpeningBuildStrategy
  estimator.py, planning/jsettlers_eta.py: SOCBuildingSpeedEstimate
  trackers.py: SOCPlayerTracker, SOCPossiblePiece/Road/Settlement/City
  roads.py: SOCPlayer.calcLongestRoad2, SOCRobotDM.recalcLongestRoadETAAux
  fast.py, planner.py, smart.py: SOCRobotDM
  projection.py: SOCPlayerTracker.recalcWinGameETA
  strategies.py: DiscardStrategy, MonopolyStrategy, SOCRobotDM,
                 SOCRobotNegotiator.getOfferToBank
  negotiation.py: SOCRobotNegotiator
  agent.py: SOCRobotBrain decision orchestration and CARLA adaptations

The Java JAR is an optional external reference, not a native-agent runtime
dependency. The Python implementations adapt CARLA phases and negotiations;
whole-policy equivalence is not claimed. See docs/benchmarks/jsettlers_port.md.
